--- !u!114 &7981904047638503118
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 11742235010345651}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 076c17b446839f640a14f369e6b389f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  objectiveText: {fileID: 0}
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 0}
  startTutorialEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ff1cccf11cbc4bb2a29b67cd88ce814, type: 2}
  tutorialList:
  - tutorials:
    - text: 'Use the mouse to look around.

        Use WASD to walk around

        Hold
        SHIFT to run.

        Press SPACE to jump.'
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: Head to the Gunnery Deck!
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: Press F on the terminals to interact with them.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
    - text: Using the shop terminal will allow you to buy ammo, which you can carry
        over to either stockpile to load the gun's magazines.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
    - text: Using the contract terminal will allow you to start a mission.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6675e747a5140534da425deb005c3285, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: Fighters are the most common and basic enemy. They rely on their mobility
        above all else, but can not sustain much damage.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c5daef0b3b0fb43af8731dcac7baceb5, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: Bombers are heavily armored enemies that make bombing runs as they pass
        over their target.
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: If you do enough damage to a bomber as it is approaching, it will stop
        its attack until it makes another run. The bomber's lights will be yellow
        when it is vulnerable.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6a4d06bd427584092a872cedb82a9dfb, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: Corvettes are the most dangerous foe you face. They unleash barrages
        of gun fire from a distance, and are difficult to take down.
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: To bring down a corvette, you must focus on destroying different parts
        of the vessel. These include guns, engines, and the bridge.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d233ced7a9c5f451e80b6706566d0b27, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: 'While in the gun, use your mouse to aim.

        Press Left Click to
        shoot.

        Hold R to reload.

        Press Tab to swap magazines.

        Hold
        W / S to raise / lower the gun.'
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: Bullets have travel time, so make sure you lead your shots!
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: As your mother ship takes enemy attacks, the heat level will rise. When
        heat levels are too high, the integrity of the mothership's hull will begins
        to decrease.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
    - text: When hull integrity reaches 0%, you lose the game! Hull integrity is
        represented by the red bar near the buttom of the HUD.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0800cd0e03fe1430cba804ecc364153a, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: Purchased ammo will drop next the terminal in the form of a crate, which
        can be picked up and carried.
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: Carry the ammo crate to one of the two ammo stockpiles, and interact
        with them to deposit the ammo for loading.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
      - {fileID: 0}
    - text: Loaded ammo will be ready for reloading while you are inside the gun.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 11d451524e4d7b3449e9cd1018f8389b, type: 2}
  - tutorials:
    - text: Starting a contract will immediately begin to spawn in hostile enemies.
      highlightTargets: []
    - text: Get in the gun and destroy all enemies to complete the mission.
      highlightTargets:
      - {fileID: 0}
    - text: When a mission is complete, you will earn currency that can be spent
        at the shop.
      highlightTargets: []
    targetEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f016097210892745986a8067a9f3f5b, type: 2}
  nextTutorialEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: da8196fdcea6a624eb962219baa27386, type: 2}
  playerInput: {fileID: 0}
  skipScreen: {fileID: 6803385438588677272}
  highlightPrefab: {fileID: 8996447137225067829, guid: e05d2952e62b6a74bbc12b47877a33ec, type: 3}
  canvasForHighlight: {fileID: 0}
